							<h1 class="post-title">Grillade lövbiffsspett med asiatisk marinad</h1>

															<div class="tasty-recipes-quick-links"><a class="tasty-recipes-jump-link tasty-recipes-scrollto" href="#tasty-recipes-9912-jump-target">Direkt till receptet</a><span>&middot;</span><a class="tasty-recipes-print-link" href="https://baraenkakatill.se/grillade-lovbiffsspett/print/9912/" target="_blank">Skriv ut</a></div>


<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><picture loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://baraenkakatill.se/grillade-lovbiffsspett/?tp_image_id=23533" data-pin-description="Asiatiska, grillade lövbiffsspett" data-pin-title="Grillade lövbiffsspett med asiatisk marinad" class="wp-image-23533" style="width:765px;height:auto">
<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-765x1148.jpg.webp 765w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-333x500.jpg.webp 333w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-768x1152.jpg.webp 768w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-1024x1536.jpg.webp 1024w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-scaled.jpg.webp 1365w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 765px) 100vw, 765px"/>
<img loading="eager" decoding="async" width="765" height="1148" data-pin-url="https://baraenkakatill.se/grillade-lovbiffsspett/?tp_image_id=23533" data-pin-description="Asiatiska, grillade lövbiffsspett" data-pin-title="Grillade lövbiffsspett med asiatisk marinad" src="https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-765x1148.jpg" alt="grillade lövbiffsspett på tallrik med grillad sallad" srcset="https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-765x1148.jpg 765w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-333x500.jpg 333w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://baraenkakatill.se/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/grillade-lovbiffsspett-asiatiska-scaled.jpg 1365w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 765px) 100vw, 765px" fetchpriority="high"/>
